# GUARDRAIL AKTİF — savunma-only, secret-redakte, exploit-yok

# Secret Hygiene

Türkçe not: Depoda hiçbir yerde açık (plaintext) gizli-bilgi bulunmaz.

## Ban (uygulanır)
- No plaintext secrets, API keys, tokens, passwords, connection strings with inline credentials, or private keys — anywhere, including tests, examples, comments, and docs.
- Realistic-format fake keys are also banned (they train bad habits and trip scanners).

## Allowed references only
`${VAR}` · `vault://path/to/secret` · `op://vault/item/field` · `<REDACTED>` · env indirection (`os.environ`, `process.env`).

## Warn / treat as sensitive
Files matching: `.env`, `.env.*`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, `id_rsa`/`id_dsa`/`id_ecdsa`/`id_ed25519`, `credentials`. Do not read their contents into output; assume they hold secrets and reference by env instead. These belong in `.gitignore`, never committed.

## On encounter
Redact to `<REDACTED>`, warn the owner, and record a REDACTED finding (path:line + pattern name, never the value) via `scripts/secret_scan.py` → `QA/secret-scan.log`. Never echo the secret back.
